{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sealine-residences-al-zorah-development-al-zorah-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":731,"crm_id":"1490","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Sealine Residences","slug":"sealine-residences-al-zorah-development-al-zorah-city","display_address":"Al Zorah City","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Al-Zorah Development","price":1487298,"display_price":"1.487M","lattitude":25.4124981,"longitude":55.4056569,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sealine Residences is an exclusive 10-storey residential development designed and developed by Al-Zorah and located in the heart of Al-Zorah City in Ajman. The project is a modern blend of elegance, cosiness and contemporary design. The project features apartments with <strong>1-3 and four-bedroom penthouses.</strong></p><p>The architecture of Sealine Residences is inspired by a nautical theme, which creates a cosy atmosphere and ensures maximum natural light inside the apartments. Each flat is characterised by a spacious layout, stylish design and the use of high quality finishing materials.</p><p>Residents of the complex can enjoy a wide range of amenities such as swimming pool, gym, recreational areas and cafes. Due to Sealine Residences' convenient location, residents have access to the beach, restaurants, shops and other amenities of Al-Zorah City. Families with children can enjoy spending time at the Pygmy Zoo.</p><p>Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road is adjacent to the complex, making it easy to get around the Emirate. Sharjah International Airport, The Oberoi Beach Resort and Al Zorah are all within 25 minutes. The UAE's first casino, soon to open on Sharjah's Al Marjan Island, can be reached in 45 minutes.</p><p>Sealine Residences is where elegance and functionality meet the beauty of the natural surroundings to create the perfect atmosphere for beachfront living. Sealine Residences is the perfect choice for lovers of comfort, beauty and stylish living by the sea.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1490/images/2024/03/20/HE5NSB3dqFVDWuUs5KM791stqlOeLi1RH1LTMdgU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/HE5NSB3dqFVDWuUs5KM791stqlOeLi1RH1LTMdgU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1490/images/2024/03/20/B3SS3HznFBOrEKa5at6cMbhTWkGAZr66wEdn9QHj.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/B3SS3HznFBOrEKa5at6cMbhTWkGAZr66wEdn9QHj.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1490/images/2024/03/20/WJxqFlW2ySGbGtqfgJLEZrBLVcQ1WJxWIYkpvPTg.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/WJxqFlW2ySGbGtqfgJLEZrBLVcQ1WJxWIYkpvPTg.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1490/images/2024/03/20/anOXpvtrynJTvFqpktJcOGMs8iBkFSchxcUhJL02.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/anOXpvtrynJTvFqpktJcOGMs8iBkFSchxcUhJL02.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2964,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/03/20/FPTVjzqGZRD2lL5rcegljslT6RriymJdD50KbO2t.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":807,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2242,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2243,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2244,"url":null,"area":null